      "description": "Software-delivery practice for agents and people working in the harness: the work plan (beans, claiming, blocking, briefs, turn reports), issues and PRs, continual progress, review and merge (prepare-merge, staging review, visual diff, rendered verification), CI health and platform gates, release and deployment, and coordinating sessions and swarms. Moved out of folio-core into the sdlc topic (bean 9umr, owner ruling 2026-09-30); crdm and spec-kit are its siblings in the same topic.",
      "hasManifest": true,
